{"4020220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "No Service", "steam_appid": 4020220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the last train inspector in charge of maintaining a crumbling subway station, your task is to investigate a series of odd occurrences and report your findings. The deeper you go, the more mind-bending the subliminal abstractions become. Try your best to progress forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPOT ANOMALIES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paranormal phenomena are plentiful here; reporting these cosmic disturbances is crucial to running a profitable subway station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Correctly spotting an anomaly will yield a check mark animation:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020220/extras/67b0d17bdd4e90d154e1ffb91a767180.poster.avif?t=1764715423\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020220/extras/67b0d17bdd4e90d154e1ffb91a767180.webm?t=1764715423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020220/extras/67b0d17bdd4e90d154e1ffb91a767180.mp4?t=1764715423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > noting regular objects will result in a tapping animation:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020220/extras/b30d00d6f2d1b3bcc146162261f22da0.poster.avif?t=1764715423\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020220/extras/b30d00d6f2d1b3bcc146162261f22da0.webm?t=1764715423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020220/extras/b30d00d6f2d1b3bcc146162261f22da0.mp4?t=1764715423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE SUBLIMINAL:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once all anomalies are found and reported, a ding can be heard. This signifies that you can progress; failing to do so will keep you in a subliminal loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020220/extras/d907b6757ad6bf8daf59ce1676ad50f2.poster.avif?t=1764715423\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020220/extras/d907b6757ad6bf8daf59ce1676ad50f2.webm?t=1764715423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020220/extras/d907b6757ad6bf8daf59ce1676ad50f2.mp4?t=1764715423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the last train inspector in charge of maintaining a crumbling subway station, your task is to investigate a series of odd occurrences and report your findings. The deeper you go, the more mind-bending the subliminal abstractions become. Try your best to progress forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPOT ANOMALIES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paranormal phenomena are plentiful here; reporting these cosmic disturbances is crucial to running a profitable subway station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Correctly spotting an anomaly will yield a check mark animation:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shar